2026-10-13T07:21:22.581Z","title_ko_status":"working_translation","themes_status":"editorial_classification"},{"id":"cma-166621","museum":"The Cleveland Museum of Art","title":"Study of the Sabine Statue from the Villa Medici","title_ko":"빌라 메디치의 사비니 여인 조각 연구","artist":"Jacques-Louis David","artist_ids":["jacques-louis-david"],"artist_status":"identified","date":"c. 1775–1780","medium":"pen and brown ink and brush and gray wash","medium_ko":"펜·갈색 잉크·회색 워시","dimensions":"Sheet: 21.4 x 14.8 cm (8 7/16 x 5 13/16 in.)","dimensions_ko":"종이 전체: 21.4 × 14.8 cm","description":"로마의 빌라 메디치에서 본 고대 조각을 다비드가 종이에 옮긴 연구입니다. 옷주름과 몸의 자세를 선과 워시로 살피며, 이탈리아 체류기에 고전 조각을 연구한 방식의 한 사례를 보여 줍니다.","culture":"France","accession":"2008.343","source_url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/2008.343","api_url":"https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/artworks/166621","preview_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/2008.343/2008.343_web.jpg","image_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/2008.343/2008.343_print.jpg","license":"CC0","license_evidence":{"share_license_status":"CC0"},"policy_url":"https://www.clevelandart.org/open-access","themes":["인물과 일상"],"taxonomy":{"periods":["early-modern"],"movements":["neoclassicism"],"kind":"drawing","subjects":["figure"],"sources":[{"label":"소장처 · 제작 시기·재료·작품 기록","url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/2008.343"},{"label":"미술관 · 사조·양식 맥락","url":"https://www.metmuseum.org/es/essays/the-legacy-of-jacques-louis-david-1748-1825"}]},"image_width":654,"image_height":893,"image_bytes":425401,"sha256":"76f2a4a2c1a97f81070e54edd6ee09c9ba7509c9df435ad5516eeacbcb236184","collected_at":"2026-10-13T07:21:22.580Z","title_ko_status":"working_translation","themes_status":"editorial_classification"},{"id":"cma-134322","museum":"The Cleveland Museum of Art","title":"Gods and Goddess","title_ko":"신들과 여신","artist":"Jacques-Louis David","artist_ids":["jacques-louis-david"],"artist_status":"identified","date":"fourth quarter 1700s or first quarter 1800s","medium":"pen and black ink","medium_ko":"펜·검은 잉크","dimensions":"Sheet: 13.2 x 21.3 cm (5 3/16 x 8 3/8 in.); Secondary Support: 17.1 x 25.1 cm (6 3/4 x 9 7/8 in.)","dimensions_ko":"종이 전체: 13.2 × 21.3 cm; 2차 지지체: 17.1 × 25.1 cm","description":"여러 인물을 나란히 세우고 옷주름과 손동작을 가는 잉크선으로 살핀 드로잉입니다. 미술관의 원제는 신들과 여신이며, 구체적인 인물 이름을 단정하지 않고 고전적인 인물 구성을 중심으로 볼 수 있습니다.","culture":"France","accession":"1956.781","source_url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/1956.781","api_url":"https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/artworks/134322","preview_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/1956.781/1956.781_web.jpg","image_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/1956.781/1956.781_print.jpg","license":"CC0","license_evidence":{"share_license_status":"CC0"},"policy_url":"https://www.clevelandart.org/open-access","themes":["신화와 상상"],"taxonomy":{"periods":["early-modern","modern"],"movements":[],"kind":"drawing","subjects":["figure","religion-myth"],"sources":[{"label":"소장처 · 제작 시기·재료·작품 기록","url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/1956.781"}]},"image_width":900,"image_height":557,"image_bytes":260632,"sha256":"e03b799cb4a5e94b7622a50e94cf16fd4edd9384545647123f158750b6158141","collected_at":"2026-10-13T07:21:22.580Z","title_ko_status":"working_translation","themes_status":"editorial_classification"},{"id":"cma-447789","museum":"The Cleveland Museum of Art","title":"Footpath in the Woods","title_ko":"숲속 오솔길","artist":"Paul Cézanne","artist_ids":["paul-cezanne"],"artist_status":"identified","date":"1882–84","medium":"watercolor and graphite on modern laid paper","medium_ko":"레이드지에 수채·흑연","dimensions":"Support: 51.6 x 35.9 cm (20 5/16 x 14 1/8 in.); Matted: 62.9 x 48.3 x 0.6 cm (24 3/4 x 19 x 1/4 in.); Image: 47.9 x 31.4 cm (18 7/8 x 12 3/8 in.)","dimensions_ko":"지지체: 51.6 × 35.9 cm; 매트 포함: 62.9 × 48.3 × 0.6 cm; 이미지: 47.9 × 31.4 cm","description":"세잔이 엑상프로방스 인근 가족의 저택 자 드 부팡의 밤나무 숲을 그린 수채화입니다. 흑연선과 옅은 수채의 면 사이에 종이의 흰 바탕을 남겨, 나무와 길을 구성하는 방식을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","culture":"France","accession":"2021.165","source_url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/2021.165","api_url":"https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/artworks/447789","preview_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/2021.165/2021.165_web.jpg","image_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/2021.165/2021.165_print.jpg","license":"CC0","license_evidence":{"share_license_status":"CC0"},"policy_url":"https://www.clevelandart.org/open-access","themes":["풍경과 빛"],"taxonomy":{"periods":["modern"],"movements":["post-impressionism"],"kind":"drawing","subjects":["landscape","nature"],"sources":[{"label":"소장처 · 제작 시기·재료·작품 기록","url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/2021.165"},{"label":"미술관 · 사조·양식 맥락","url":"https://www.metmuseum.org/essays/post-impressionism"}]},"image_width":595,"image_height":900,"image_bytes":187763,"sha256":"479894e3fa87a835d16f7236530bc1c08c4fb3fe4a780a25e70140f68754551b","collected_at":"2026-10-13T07:21:22.580Z","title_ko_status":"working_translation","themes_status":"editorial_classification"},{"id":"cma-166671","museum":"The Cleveland Museum of Art","title":"Sheet of Studies","title_ko":"여러 습작이 있는 종이","artist":"Paul Cézanne","artist_ids":["paul-cezanne"],"artist_status":"identified","date":"1871–76","medium":"graphite and pen and brown ink","medium_ko":"흑연·펜·갈색 잉크","dimensions":"Sheet: 20.9 x 12.2 cm (8 1/4 x 4 13/16 in.)","dimensions_ko":"종이 전체: 20.9 × 12.2 cm","description":"한 장의 종이에 인물과 형태의 연구를 겹쳐 놓은 세잔의 드로잉입니다. 흑연과 갈색 잉크의 서로 다른 선을 따라, 세부를 반복해 살피고 구상을 정리하는 과정을 볼 수 있습니다.","culture":"France, 19th century","accession":"2008.385","source_url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/2008.385","api_url":"https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/artworks/166671","preview_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/2008.385/2008.385_web.jpg","image_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/2008.385/2008.385_print.jpg","license":"CC0","license_evidence":{"share_license_status":"CC0"},"policy_url":"https://www.clevelandart.org/open-access","themes":["인물과 일상"],"taxonomy":{"periods":["modern"],"movements":[