.org/art/1924.489"}]},"image_width":554,"image_height":893,"image_bytes":98636,"sha256":"19df55dfda9b539363f43518306b7ac0fac111d502c7649575da2b90de583d9a","collected_at":"2026-10-13T07:21:22.604Z","title_ko_status":"working_translation","themes_status":"editorial_classification"},{"id":"cma-160406","museum":"The Cleveland Museum of Art","title":"The Menpes Children","title_ko":"멘페스의 아이들","artist":"James McNeill Whistler","artist_ids":["james-mcneill-whistler"],"artist_status":"identified","date":"1887","medium":"etching","medium_ko":"에칭","dimensions":"Sheet: 16.7 x 19.2 cm (6 9/16 x 7 9/16 in.); Platemark: 6.7 x 10.1 cm (2 5/8 x 4 in.)","dimensions_ko":"종이 전체: 16.7 × 19.2 cm; 판흔: 6.7 × 10.1 cm","description":"아이들의 얼굴과 몸짓을 가는 선으로 빠르게 살핀 휘슬러의 에칭입니다. 넓게 남긴 종이 바탕 속에서 인물들이 가볍게 드러나며, 완성된 초상 회화와 다른 간결한 인물 표현을 볼 수 있습니다.","culture":"America","accession":"1998.242","source_url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/1998.242","api_url":"https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/artworks/160406","preview_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/1998.242/1998.242_web.jpg","image_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/1998.242/1998.242_print.jpg","license":"CC0","license_evidence":{"share_license_status":"CC0"},"policy_url":"https://www.clevelandart.org/open-access","themes":["인물과 일상"],"taxonomy":{"periods":["modern"],"movements":[],"kind":"print","subjects":["figure","daily-life"],"sources":[{"label":"소장처 · 제작 시기·재료·작품 기록","url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/1998.242"}]},"image_width":1263,"image_height":864,"image_bytes":681644,"sha256":"ee684a81a4791d07eebe609a76393c569c3677733be07b7f95f62fb6596a3f14","collected_at":"2026-10-13T07:21:22.607Z","title_ko_status":"working_translation","themes_status":"editorial_classification"},{"id":"cma-143090","museum":"The Cleveland Museum of Art","title":"The Pool","title_ko":"풀 — 항구의 수면","artist":"James McNeill Whistler","artist_ids":["james-mcneill-whistler"],"artist_status":"identified","date":"1859","medium":"etching","medium_ko":"에칭","dimensions":"Sheet: 34.3 x 25.6 cm (13 1/2 x 10 1/16 in.); Platemark: 21.1 x 13.6 cm (8 5/16 x 5 3/8 in.)","dimensions_ko":"종이 전체: 34.3 × 25.6 cm; 판흔: 21.1 × 13.6 cm","description":"강 위의 배와 부두, 멀리 이어지는 건물을 선으로 기록한 휘슬러의 에칭입니다. 전경의 배와 뒤쪽 도시가 서로 다른 밀도로 그려져, 항구의 복잡한 일상과 공간의 깊이가 함께 드러납니다.","culture":"America","accession":"1966.84","source_url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/1966.84","api_url":"https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/artworks/143090","preview_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/1966.84/1966.84_web.jpg","image_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/1966.84/1966.84_print.jpg","license":"CC0","license_evidence":{"share_license_status":"CC0"},"policy_url":"https://www.clevelandart.org/open-access","themes":["풍경과 빛"],"taxonomy":{"periods":["modern"],"movements":[],"kind":"print","subjects":["landscape","daily-life"],"sources":[{"label":"소장처 · 제작 시기·재료·작품 기록","url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/1966.84"}]},"image_width":1263,"image_height":831,"image_bytes":907309,"sha256":"621480b221fcf826d77dff44a9f1dcda432e1e23f5b4016fb3930b912e324ff7","collected_at":"2026-10-13T07:21:22.608Z","title_ko_status":"working_translation","themes_status":"editorial_classification"},{"id":"cma-143093","museum":"The Cleveland Museum of Art","title":"Old Hungerford Bridge","title_ko":"옛 헝거퍼드 다리","artist":"James McNeill Whistler","artist_ids":["james-mcneill-whistler"],"artist_status":"identified","date":"1861","medium":"etching and drypoint","medium_ko":"에칭","dimensions":"Sheet: 24 x 18.1 cm (9 7/16 x 7 1/8 in.); Platemark: 21.1 x 13.6 cm (8 5/16 x 5 3/8 in.)","dimensions_ko":"종이 전체: 24 × 18.1 cm; 판흔: 21.1 × 13.6 cm","description":"강을 가로지르는 옛 헝거퍼드 다리와 주변의 배들을 그린 에칭입니다. 다리의 길게 이어진 선과 강변의 구조물을 간결하게 배치해, 런던의 수변 풍경을 관찰하는 휘슬러의 시선을 보여 줍니다.","culture":"America","accession":"1966.87","source_url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/1966.87","api_url":"https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/artworks/143093","preview_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/1966.87