m.org/essays/albrecht-durer-1471-1528"}]},"image_width":720,"image_height":900,"image_bytes":257500,"sha256":"93e21c2c808abd8b456c283f9bde68cc694d174e355ba4365473f2c769067d85","collected_at":"2026-10-13T07:21:22.607Z","title_ko_status":"working_translation","themes_status":"editorial_classification"},{"id":"cma-130151","museum":"The Cleveland Museum of Art","title":"Ascension of Christ","title_ko":"그리스도의 승천","artist":"Albrecht Dürer","artist_ids":["albrecht-durer"],"artist_status":"identified","date":"c. 1515","medium":"pen and brown ink","medium_ko":"펜·갈색 잉크","dimensions":"Sheet: 31 x 22.1 cm (12 3/16 x 8 11/16 in.); Framed: 52.5 x 39.8 x 2.3 cm (20 11/16 x 15 11/16 x 7/8 in.)","dimensions_ko":"종이 전체: 31 × 22.1 cm; 액자 포함: 52.5 × 39.8 × 2.3 cm","description":"축복의 손짓을 하고 십자가가 달린 구를 든 그리스도가 구름 위로 오르는 장면입니다. 뒤러는 구름 속 천사와 아래쪽의 발자국을 함께 배치해, 승천의 이야기를 세밀한 펜선으로 풀어냈습니다.","culture":"Germany","accession":"1952.530","source_url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/1952.530","api_url":"https://openaccess-api.clevelandart.org/api/artworks/130151","preview_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/1952.530/1952.530_web.jpg","image_url":"https://openaccess-cdn.clevelandart.org/1952.530/1952.530_print.jpg","license":"CC0","license_evidence":{"share_license_status":"CC0"},"policy_url":"https://www.clevelandart.org/open-access","themes":["신화와 상상"],"taxonomy":{"periods":["early-modern"],"movements":["renaissance"],"kind":"drawing","subjects":["figure","religion-myth"],"sources":[{"label":"소장처 · 제작 시기·재료·작품 기록","url":"https://clevelandart.org/art/1952.530"},{"label":"미술관 · 사조·양식 맥락","url":"https://www.metmuseum.org/essays/albrecht-durer-1471-1528"}]},"image_width":641,"image_height":893,"image_bytes":162397,"sha256":"df8127c1467f9e0d9e68bad4dbeb58667917a5aea6c4b4c544b64b4d7b3f0136","collected_at":"2026-10-13T07:21:22.612Z","title_ko_status":"working_translation","themes_status":"editorial_classification"},{"id":"cma-136609","museum":"The Cleveland Museum of Art","title":"Hercules at the C